The '''Lacertilo''' were an [[Amphibian|amphibious]] [[species]] with compound [[lung]]s. [[Resistance]] member [[Bo Rogiave]] was a Lacertilo, using his biology to his advantage when on missions where [[oxygen]] levels were thin.<ref name="TROS VD" /> Two [[Unidentified bailiff|Lacertilo bailiffs]] served at an [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Niamos Courthouse|courthouse]] on [[Niamos]] and attended the sentencing of [[Cassian Jeron Andor|Cassian Andor]]<ref name="Announcement" /> in [[5 BBY]]<ref name="Date 5BBY">{{AndorDate|107}}</ref> for a crime he did not commit.<ref name="Announcement" /> A handful were also present at [[Samaria]]'s [[Imperial Court of Criminal Justice]].<ref name="A Trick of the Mind">{{StoryCite|story=A Trick of the Mind|book=Revelations (2023) 1}}</ref>

